{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_01",
  "title": "赴大荒",
  "storyCode": "HS-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "132aa86787c083d7162f586c16bf45abcb0fe281b77c91577aa224f20231739e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三個月前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚奇的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼……？！手上這條斷了的是人紋不是地紋，意思是我不會有什麼大病大災，其實是頭殼出了問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快樂的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，都說了那棵核桃樹就是幫你種的，趕快去施肥吧，遲了可不好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不是這麼說，這道斷紋只是代表著你大概在二十出頭的年紀，會遇到一個很困難的抉擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是哪有十全十美的出路呢，順其自然吧。你看，之後的紋路不就平整多了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚奇的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "準！太準了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚奇的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我二十三歲的時候，老家的農田被天災毀了，當時我實在不知道去移動城市能討到什麼生計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚奇的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在跟著大家來到大荒城研究莊稼，做回老本行了，不也活得挺好的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快樂的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有這種事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪有人真的能預測命數呢，不過是給發生的事找個理由罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚奇的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前只知道天師府的天師神通廣大，沒想到還懂得這麼多……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚奇的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黍姑娘，您這麼年輕就已經是這裡天師府的資深授業天師了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聞道有先後，只是先學到了一些知識，再把它轉述給更多人罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快樂的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "了不起，了不起，不過……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快樂的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黍姑娘，我看那邊有個年輕小伙子盯著你看半天了……是你的熟人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是位貴客。抱歉，我們改天再聊吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大炎司歲台秉燭人，左樂，奉命前來監管大荒城建設以及歲獸相關事務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不會限制黍小姐的日常活動，但希望黍小姐近日不要離開大荒城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還請黍小姐配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，之前聽說要新來一位秉燭人，原來就是你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是司歲台例行的檢查，並不會妨礙黍小姐的農業研究，黍小姐只要專心原本的事務，不必擔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼看上去這麼年輕，今年成年了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡地方偏遠，來的路上還順利嗎？有沒有遇到歹徒刁難？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還不至於被幾個匪徒為難住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以及，關於此處十二樓五城的修建，司歲台支持各位與炎國工部共同施行、合作共贏，希望各位能夠與諸位天師友好相處，少生事端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除此之外，還有一些事情需要……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，平常活動的話，這裡田間可以隨便走，小心別踩到莊稼就行，但要是去工廠那邊恐怕還是要提前和天師他們打招呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黍小姐……工作範圍，我還是清楚的。我還有……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上一個秉燭人在這裡住過的房子是那一間，平常生活用的物件已經換過新的，你可以直接用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，就是這些了，你還有什麼問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒……沒有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，田間要忙的事還有不少，我就不多招呼你啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是還遇到什麼困難，開口和周圍鄉親打招呼就行，這裡的人都好客，不會讓你為難的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不好意思，這位姑娘，我有公務——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "便當？這是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "餓了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在這一動不動站了一整天，看上去呆呆的，都不知道自己找飯吃，像個稻草人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多……多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吃嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "非常可口……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說，你就準備白吃嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳咳咳……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小滿，這位是客人，不能這麼沒禮貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可這不是黍姐姐說的嘛？住在大荒城的每一個人，都是跟莊稼打了交道，流了汗才能吃飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個人奇奇怪怪，說是有公務，但是不種田也不去造房子，不知道來做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這位先生，有他自己的工作的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就在這乾瞪眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就在這乾瞪眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知有什麼……我能幫得上忙的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我想想……\n插秧機，你會操作嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也是，你平常的工作應該也不會和這些農具打交道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個小方塊，叫六相儀，只要用這個控制天樁插到田裡對應的位置，就能分區塊監測農田狀況——你會用嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也沒有瞭解過……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那給牧獸餵草料……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你要在這裡留一段時間的話，不如就趁這段時間試著做些農事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不如，先學著把試驗田裡那些沒處理的野草都鋤乾淨吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老師您在嗎，我這裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小禾，來得正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這位……\n是我在京城的遠房表弟，這段時間在大荒城休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這位就是我的學生禾生，他可以來教你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "定位器顯示牧獸就在這一片嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯！我吹這隻羽獸笛，綿綿就知道我在找他，就會出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "定位器是……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城每頭牧獸身上都會有，雖然不能精準定位，但能看到大概位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城上萬頭牧獸，每頭都有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前發生過不少牧獸走丟的事情，師兄們養的課題經常被外面的異性吸引走——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……抱歉，確實沒怎麼接觸過這些東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你既然是老師的遠房親戚，為什麼要去當兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不足為外人道也。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "家裡當官的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……怎麼這麼問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你講話的方式。還有那股精氣神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們這裡的同齡人很少有這樣的，有也是高貴子弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我無意冒犯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也沒說你冒犯到誰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奇怪，為什麼不出來呢……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "綿綿前幾天跟小辮兒吵架了，難道是因為這個他才走的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道又是被外面的母獸吸引走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "什麼？\n但他是喜歡小辮兒的！每天我帶他們去泥塘裡滾泥，他們兩個都要在一起的耶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這可不行，小燭台！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小、小燭台……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我幫你畫下他的樣子，你看一看記下來，我們分頭去找！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……小滿姑娘筆力深厚，令人一目了然……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你認真的？我知道綿綿都認不出，你能認得出？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不就是四條腿，身上長花斑，哪裡看不出？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小燭台，你在外面看過牧獸嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很少見到……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒關係，你沒看過牧獸，我也沒看過移動城市，大家都有沒看過的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你從來沒去過外面——其他的城市嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒去過，但聽小禾說過不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡種的稻穀每年都會送到外面，他們還在研究新種子，就是要讓外面的人都吃飽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以後有的是機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不著急，我本來就更喜歡這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊！正好，你聞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……酒香？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我最喜歡吃稻米甜酒釀！你看那邊有蒸氣的地方就是釀酒的廠子，我們等一下可以順路去那裡看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來這裡還有酒廠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "每季收穫，我們都會專門留一些稻穀釀酒，最陳的那一壇好像已經有了百多年的歷史。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你喝過酒嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "曾經喝過一點……是執行任務時遇到的老鄉給的玉米葉子酒。又辣又嗆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他讓我們喝了暖暖身子，但我們沒想到是這種酒。他說飯都不夠吃，哪還有多餘的糧食做酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……在外面，還是會有人吃不飽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這片土地太寬廣了……不同地方，差異很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽到了……是在那邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哇，小燭台，你飛得好高……\n肯定能很快找到綿綿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們的無人機能飛得更高，還有定位功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "用不著這麼——\n等等，那邊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼在著火？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三個月？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三個月。這項工程不是兒戲，我們需要時間來確保每一個環節都不出問題，三個月能做完就已經是謝天謝地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“十二樓五城”，這幾個字可不是簡單的詩歌摘抄。你知道這些……“原型”在大炎歷代天師心裡躺了多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自然。我也知道，萬事起頭難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在下雖然是行政官員，但好歹也是天師府的學生。源石技藝當然不如各位精湛，但不是每天只坐在桌子後面盯著自己的天師儀喝茶水的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三個月，當年大雪紛飛的炎北地區，我們也花了三個月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "諸位天師好好考慮過再給我一個回覆。大荒城核心區最後兩個地塊的組裝工作，還要多少時間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深土木天師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是能源物資補給充足的話，大概一月出頭……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "源石能源的事不用擔心，補給的物資我已經反覆督促了。各位天師只管趕上工程進度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天高地遠，且不說建城，物資的運輸都是一項大工程，我們這裡多耽擱一天，耗費的資源財力都是大數字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算是為了體卹年年納稅的百姓，也容不得我們懈怠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在是六月，希望中秋節時，各位都已經回到家中和親人團聚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪裡都逃不掉遍地羽毛的事，寧小姐見笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“三個月”“炎北地區”，說的是那年的丹燕城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大雪封城，朝廷已經決定要停工等待，可等信使到了那裡，卻發現領頭的天師以一座地塊為刀……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……撞開了冰封的源石晶層，救下了數萬被困在嚴冬裡的村鎮百姓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這段故事如今都被寫進了教科書裡，萬侍郎事後也因此平步青雲，剛才的說辭還真是謙虛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，您誤會了。我也不過是個從底層一步一步爬上來的土木天師，哪敢擺什麼架子呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工部侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是唯有提起這事，這些辛勞的天師才願意放下怨氣，聽我多說幾句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來萬侍郎有十足把握，十二樓五城的進度不會有什麼問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，就算我有信心，各項事宜，還是有點太倉促了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就是再小心，也難免有疏漏，到時候還要麻煩寧侍郎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "分內之職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……寧小姐初到大荒城不久，對這裡環境還不太熟悉吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然位於邊境，比不上內陸繁華，但物產豐富，尤其是作物做出的特色小吃，又風趣，又好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比如，我想想，寧小姐吃過城內的“五豆粥”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很遺憾，還沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城的五豆粥與其他地方不大一樣，算是特色了。多用新品種的五豆，即紅豆、黑豆、綠豆、黃豆和白雲豆熬煮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，雖然五豆相得益彰，但大荒城的五豆粥之所以是一絕，還是靠著這裡獨一無二的……稻米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城稻米香甜，風味濃郁，才能成為這一碗佳餚的基底，才能讓平平無奇的五豆粥成為大荒城飲食文化的象徵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看似五豆一米，各成滋味，但說到底，成在稻米。所以烹飪起來，也不是一鍋亂煮就了事了，有些講究的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "訣竅在於火候。不能讓其餘五豆喧賓奪主，要是失去了稻香底色，那這碗粥，就變回無味寡淡平平無奇的雜糧粥了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "寧小姐有空，一定得嚐嚐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，寧尚書最近身體還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祖父年紀大了，沒病是福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老人家，還是要保重身體。不如下次回百灶述職時，為老尚書帶些薄禮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬侍郎有這份心意就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然大荒城與歲獸有關，那我也少不了和司歲台、禮部打交道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我過去就對寧尚書過往的壯舉欽佩不已，可惜歲月不饒人……時至今日，寧尚書還是少操勞些具體事的好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是有人覺得我出現在大荒城屬於多管閒事，我可以立刻去信一封，遞交太傅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您又誤會了，我只是想說，寧小姐年紀輕輕就能勝任侍郎一職，是寧家的幸事，是寧尚書教導有方——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬侍郎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萬侍郎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是您只是想說，“毫無實績的寧辭秋不配和丹燕城的傳奇天師共事”，那我不否認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是你我同事一場，以後，還希望您打開天窗說亮話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要彎彎繞繞自以為聰明。真聰明的人，比你討喜得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告辭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快，水桶，水桶！還好火剛燒起來，還是在河邊……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你為什麼會在林子邊上生火？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "燒山可是重罪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒有要燒山！是師姐！她的課題是隻羽獸，那羽獸吃了我的課題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……只給我的課題那片地上留下了一顆蛋，我要烤了這顆蛋……洩憤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不是洩憤，我只是要烤了這顆蛋紀念我逝去的課題！嗚……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別廢話了！快快快，火要燒到後面去了！快把火苗踩滅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給你鋤頭，趁風不大，快清出隔離帶來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去清開後面的植物，不能讓火燒到後面去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "走丟的牧獸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……哞……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？……綿綿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綿綿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我終於找到你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼跑到這裡來了？……你先偷偷告訴我，你到底喜不喜歡小辮兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以左樂那小子去哪了，說去清開後面的植物，人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不會是小燭台他……迷路了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綿綿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……哞……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……那我們再去找找他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綿綿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……哞……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "左——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在這。我剛剛去那邊，沒找到綿……呃，綿綿，但是在一個草窩裡發現了這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩隻還未睜眼的牧獸幼崽被左樂用外衣裹緊，抱在懷中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……這樣小的幼獸，你不該把它們帶回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我仔細查看了四周，母獸不在附近，放它們在那裡肯定會喪命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帶回來接受你們的統一管理，不是更好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是“管理”，我們都是朋友！是互幫互助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們能給我們帶來絨毛，我們為他們提供好吃的草料，順便也幫著驅趕一下蚊蟲，搔搔癢癢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "野生的幼崽帶回大荒城，不確定是否有傳染病，也不確定它們能不能接受飼養，而且……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但他都已經抱在懷裡了，沾上了味道，就算還回去母獸也不會要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我才說他不應該把它們帶回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但帶回來了肯定要處理啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小滿，明明是他什麼都不懂，有錯在先，你為什麼總是在為他說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對啊，就是因為他什麼都不懂，還做錯了事，是個笨蛋，我才這樣的啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，我回去問問老師們，看看要怎麼處理兩個小傢伙。我們快點回去吧，別讓他們著涼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊！又是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兇大叔，你今天午餐吃了嗎？剛才這邊著火了，你又不會說話，要不是我們你就被燒到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小滿，別靠過去了，小心他的斧子真的砍到你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他才不會呢，只要我一吹笛子，他就安靜下來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他很喜歡我吹笛子，每次來都是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老樵夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看吧！你們都說這裡不能來，但我經常偷偷跑來這裡的，就是河對岸一直過不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兇大叔只要一聽我吹這首歌就會安靜，我看過他笑的。\n我還能像這樣靠過去摸摸他的斧子，他總是緊緊地握著，但其實他很……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼突然打我，我生氣了，下次我不帶吃的給你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——小滿，別過去了，快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那這兩隻幼崽……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……帶回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下次做事前，先動動腦子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（我來這裡這麼久……究竟都做了什麼？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
